@startuml
title C4 Level 2 - BFS and DFS Search System

left to right direction

rectangle "User" as User

rectangle "Input Module\n[Python]" as Input
rectangle "Search Controller\n[Python]" as Controller
rectangle "BFS Module\n[Python]" as BFS
rectangle "DFS Module\n[Python]" as DFS
rectangle "Profiling Module\n[py-spy]" as Profiling
rectangle "Comparison Module\n[Python]" as Comparison
rectangle "Result Module\n[Python]" as Result

User --> Input : Provides graph\nand search input
Input --> Controller : Sends input
Controller --> BFS : Select BFS
Controller --> DFS : Select DFS
BFS --> Profiling : BFS execution
DFS --> Profiling : DFS execution
Profiling --> Comparison : Profiling results
BFS --> Result : Search result
DFS --> Result : Search result
Comparison --> Result : Comparison result
Result --> User : Displays result

@enduml